SUMMARY:The HIVE Anniversary Party
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate The HIVE’s 5th anniversary and Z Specialty Food’s 47th during this FREE community event. \nKick off your holiday shopping\, taste 30+ varietal honeys\, craft mead and enjoy selections from our farm-to-fork menu. This over the top celebration features live music from Wolf Jett\, steep holiday discounts\, giveaways and interactive activities for all ages including honey and mead tastings\, honey bee education with live bees\, tours of our pollinator garden and facility\, a HIVE Spelling Bee and Waggle Dance Competition. \nIn honor of 47 years of business and The HIVE’s 5th year\, we’re offering a $20 Gift Card with each $100 retail purchase in the warehouse. \nThe HIVE\, a vibrant community gathering space\, is home to Moon Shine Trading Co. and Island of the Moon Honey\, visionaries of varietal honey since 1979.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/the-hive-anniversary-party-3/
LOCATION:The HIVE / Z Specialty Food\, The HIVE Tasting Room and Kitchen
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025-HIVE-Anniversary-Party.jpg
