 3](https://zoom.us/j/589676463)\n**Bi-Weekly Friday Zoom Sessions** *(Ever
 y 2nd and 4th Friday)*\n• **4:00 PM** – Advanced Korean with Stephen\n
 • **5:00 PM** – Intermediate Conversational Chinese with Sam\n• **6:
 00 PM** – Bible Study & Meditation Group with Stephen\n• **7:00 PM** 
 – Beginning Chinese with Jane\n**Weekly Saturday Zoom Sessions** (total 
 of 10 sessions)\n• **4:00 PM** – Beginning Spanish with Viviana\n• *
 *5:00 PM** – Beginning to Intermediate Korean with Stephen\n• **6:00 P
 M** – Beginning to Intermediate Japanese with Norio\n• **7:00 PM** –
  English Learners Group with Linda & Chad\n___\n**Important Notes:**\n1. *
