DESCRIPTION:The Alex Makeev Trio is a forward-thinking jazz trio performing dreamy originals\, unique arrangements of jazz standards\, and pop interpretations. Featuring Aidan Smith on drums and Arlo Jones on Bass. \nAlex Makeev Website \n$15 Gen Adm\n$10 Students\nUnder 12 FREE\nDoors open at 7:30pm \nCash or Venmo at the door only (no Credit Card) \nThis is a BYOB event
