SUMMARY:Fall Everlasting Centerpiece Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join Rafael in our Flower Barn for a hands-on workshop where you’ll create a signature Fall or Thanksgiving everlasting centerpiece—perfect for bringing seasonal charm to your table and becoming a cherished holiday tradition. Using dried flowers harvested from our own fields\, Rafael will guide you step by step in crafting a piece that’s not only unique but truly stunning. \n$125 per person \n*water and hot tea provided
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/fall-everlasting-centerpiece-workshop/2026-11-15/
LOCATION:Park Winters\, Park Winters\, 27850 County Road 26 Winters\, CA 95694
