CREATED:20261005T173057Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T183021Z
UID:10003086-1795291200-1795298400@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Kevin Seconds Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Live music @ The Melon Ball in Davis. \nKevin Seconds is a Sacramento-born singer\, songwriter\, and guitarist best known as the frontman of the influential punk band 7 Seconds\, which he founded in 1979 with his brother Steve Youth. Alongside decades of touring and releasing records with the band\, Seconds has built a prolific solo career since the early 1990s\, performing across the U.S. and the U.K. and releasing multiple albums that explore folk\, indie\, and alternative acoustic styles. His solo work often features collaborations with his wife\, Allyson Seconds\, and showcases his sharp songwriting\, warm storytelling\, and a distinctly DIY spirit that has defined his entire musical life. \nKevin’s Website Here \n$20 General Admission\nDoors open at 7:30pm \nCash or Venmo at the door only (no Credit Card) \nThis is a BYOB event! \nPresented by Left of the Dial Promotions and KDRT 95.7 fm
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/kevin-seconds-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/112126_Web-1-0MRjeq.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
