SUMMARY:Guru Nanak Gurpurab
DESCRIPTION:Guru Nanak Gurpurab celebrates the birth of Guru Nanak\, the founder of Sikhism. His teachings emphasize equality\, compassion\, honest living\, and service to others. The celebration offers an opportunity to learn about Sikh traditions and the importance of caring for and respecting all members of our community. \nLearn more at the Sikh Coalition.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/guru-nanak-gurpurab/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Gurpurab.jpg
END:VEVENT
