SUMMARY:Thanksgiving
DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving is a time when many people gather to share meals\, express gratitude\, and connect with loved ones. It is also an opportunity to practice generosity\, welcome neighbors who may be alone\, and acknowledge Indigenous perspectives and histories as part of a fuller understanding of this holiday. \nLearn more at History.com
