SUMMARY:Davis Community Church: Thanksgiving Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Davis Community Church invites community members to a free Thanksgiving Dinner on Thursday\, November 26\, from 4:00 to 7:00 p.m. at the DCC Fellowship Hall\, 421 D Street. Participants are welcome to gather with friends and neighbors to share a meal and celebrate the holiday together. \nThe event is free\, and an RSVP is requested to help ensure there is enough food for everyone. To RSVP\, complete the online registration form.
